{
  "_doc": "V57 per-asset build rules (D-275). Read by the intake into asset_manifest; the assembly applies them on every build (Visual prefab colliders and shadows, kept prefabs refreshed on re-delivery; material shader; companion prefabs per layout instance; cull_below: not drawn nor animated below that screen-height fraction, D-283). Later rules win.",
